# nr-relay-twin-perf: reduced by the wire audit (t19). Already applied: tests/twin_perf.rs, tests/twin_perf/, the crate dependencies.

## native/core/crates/mixdog-relay/Cargo.toml (in-crate edit) is NOT applied. Anchor: the [[test]] blocks (after name = "twin"). Add:

    [[test]]
    name = "twin_perf"
    path = "tests/twin_perf.rs"
    required-features = ["test-support"]

Without it the target is built without the test-support feature, relay_twin_host is not built and env!("CARGO_BIN_EXE_relay_twin_host") in tests/twin/proc.rs does not resolve.
Run: cargo nextest run -p mixdog-relay --release --features test-support --offline -E 'binary(twin_perf)' --run-ignored only --success-output immediate (see tests/twin_perf/README.md).
